I stand at the bus stop with my cake.
The yellow bus comes quickly.
I step inside and find a seat.
The bus drives through the city.
The trip is not long.
Soon we are at my street.
I get off the bus.
The evening air is a little cold now.
But I have my warm sweater on.
I walk down the street.
I know the buildings well now.
Here is my building.
I find my keys in my bag.
I unlock the heavy front door.
I walk into the stairwell.
It is quiet and peaceful here.
I put my bag down by the door.
I live in Copenhagen.
The evening can begin.
